# Line endings are a build input here, not a cosmetic detail.
#
# The .skill archives under dist/ are byte-compared against the source trees
# under skills/ by CI. A file authored on Windows carries CRLF, the ZIP
# captures it verbatim, and git normalises the committed copy to LF. The
# comparison then fails on Linux for a file nobody edited, and the diff that
# would explain it is invisible because a ZIP has no diff.
#
# Forcing LF in the working tree keeps the archive and the source identical on
# every machine that builds them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.skill binary
*.plugin binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
